'''Akkha's Phantom''' is a monster encountered in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It is summoned alongside [[Kephri's Phantom]] by [[Elidinis' Warden]] in the third phase of the final battle.

As a phantom of [[Akkha]], it will use its standard attacks to attack the player. It will switch between [[ranged]] and [[magic]]al attacks every 3 attacks. It will also always start with Ranged. If the Stay Vigilant invocation is enabled, it will switch between attacks randomly instead.

